            <ArticleTitle>[Use of carvedilol in daily practice].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>647-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Studies conducted over recent years have definitively confirmed beta-blockers as the major treatment for heart failure. However, they are difficult to use and, to date, only carvedilol has been granted a Marketing Authorisation for this indication. The practical aspects of treatment with carvedilol in these patients are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
